{"title":"Education Without Pause: How AI and Digitalization Can Strengthen Learning in Times of Crisis","description":"Pandemics, climate crises, conflicts, and migration have shown that education is one of society’s most vulnerable systems. The question is no longer if children’s learning will be disrupted, but how we ensure that education can continue even when society is under severe pressure.","extendedDescription":"AI and digital tools are creating new opportunities to build flexible, resilient educational solutions that improve access to learning, support teachers, and help students continue to grow and develop, even in times of uncertainty. At the same time, this development raises important questions about pedagogy, critical thinking, and how technology can be used to strengthen rather than replace human capability and independent thought.

